# Unit27
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit27核心词汇

note/noʊt/笔记；注意/Please take notes during the lecture.
nothing/ˈnʌθɪŋ/没有什么/There is nothing to worry about.
notice/ˈnoʊtɪs/通知；注意/Did you notice anything unusual?
novel/ˈnɑːvl/小说；新颖的/She wrote a bestselling novel.
nowadays/ˈnaʊədeɪz/如今/Nowadays, most people use smartphones.
nuclear/ˈnjuːkliər/核的/Nuclear energy is a controversial topic.
number/ˈnʌmbər/数字/What is your phone number?
numerous/ˈnuːmərəs/众多的/Numerous studies support this theory.
nurse/nɜːrs/护士/The nurse took care of the patients.
nutrition/njuˈtrɪʃn/营养/Good nutrition is essential for health.
object/ˈɑːbdʒekt/物体；反对/He objected to the plan.
objective/əbˈdʒektɪv/目标；客观的/Our main objective is to improve quality.
obligation/ˌɑːblɪˈɡeɪʃn/义务/It is our obligation to protect the environment.
observe/əbˈzɜːrv/观察/Scientists observe the stars through telescopes.
obtain/əbˈteɪn/获得/She obtained a degree in engineering.
obvious/ˈɑːbviəs/明显的/It was obvious that he was lying.
occasion/əˈkeɪʒn/场合/This is a special occasion for celebration.
occupy/ˈɑːkjupaɪ/占据/The meeting occupied the whole morning.
occur/əˈkɜːr/发生/The accident occurred at midnight.
ocean/ˈoʊʃn/海洋/The Pacific Ocean is the largest ocean in the world.
odd/ɑːd/奇怪的；奇数的/It's odd that she didn't come.
offer/ˈɔːfər/提供/He offered to help with the project.
office/ˈɔːfɪs/办公室/She works in an office downtown.
official/əˈfɪʃl/官方的/This is an official announcement.
often/ˈɔːfn/经常/She often goes to the gym after work.
oil/ɔɪl/石油；油/The country depends on oil exports.
old/oʊld/老的/How old are you?
once/wʌns/一次/I've been to Paris once.
only/ˈoʊnli/唯一的/She is the only child in the family.
operate/ˈɑːpəreɪt/操作；经营/Do you know how to operate this machine?
opinion/əˈpɪnjən/意见/In my opinion, this is the best choice.
opponent/əˈpoʊnənt/对手/He defeated his opponent in the match.
opportunity/ˌɑːpərˈtuːnəti/机会/This is a great opportunity for you.
oppose/əˈpoʊz/反对/Many people opposed the new policy.
opposite/ˈɑːpəzɪt/对面的；相反的/The bank is opposite the supermarket.
ordinary/ˈɔːrdneri/普通的/It was just an ordinary day.
organ/ˈɔːrɡən/器官；风琴/The heart is a vital organ.
organize/ˈɔːrɡənaɪz/组织/She organized a charity event.
origin/ˈɔːrɪdʒɪn/起源/The origin of this tradition dates back centuries.
original/əˈrɪdʒənl/原始的；独创的/The original painting is in the museum.
other/ˈʌðər/其他的/Do you have any other questions?
ought/ɔːt/应该/You ought to apologize for your mistake.
outcome/ˈaʊtkʌm/结果/The outcome of the election was surprising.
outer/ˈaʊtər/外部的/The outer wall of the building needs painting.
outlet/ˈaʊtlet/出口；插座/There is an electrical outlet near the desk.
output/ˈaʊtpʊt/产量/The factory's output has doubled this year.
outside/ˌaʊtˈsaɪd/外面/The children are playing outside.
outstanding/aʊtˈstændɪŋ/杰出的/She is an outstanding student.
overcome/ˌoʊvərˈkʌm/克服/She overcame many difficulties in her life.
overlook/ˌoʊvərˈlʊk/俯瞰；忽视/Don't overlook the small details.
